{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"F01 authorization correction\n\nThe operator identified that F01 merged character restrictions that had been rejected with F02. Ticket history confirmed the scope error. The F01 description now removes the rejected punctuation, diction, voice, and paragraph requirements, records the five-file corrective set, and reopens the affected acceptance criteria and gates. The prior close attempt and provenance-format investigation are superseded by this authorization correction. No project file has changed since the correction was issued."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787350075544626001,"uuid":"db358e3f-9a83-465d-9500-374d1b891fc2"}